n hunds tandvård – hemma, utan stress.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_WiqM8k":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Betalning & Leverans","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p><strong>Betalning:<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Du kan betala tryggt med Klarna, Swish, kort eller banköverföring – välj det som passar dig bäst.<\/p><p><strong>Leveranstid:<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Då vårt svenska lager för tillfället är slut skickas din beställning från vårt internationella lager.<\/p><ul><li>1–3 dagars orderhantering<\/li><li>4–9 dagars frakttid<\/li><\/ul><p>Spårningsnummer skickas via e-post när paketet lämnar lagret<br\/><br\/>Har du frågor?<br\/><br\/>Kontakta oss genom kontaktformuläret – vi svarar inom 24h på vardagar.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"description":{"type":"description","disabled":true,"settings":{"margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}}},"block_order":["title","rating_stars_NytK7e","price","text_LxKHa6","text_nyRh9f","de244682-4323-4802-b4ba-b79b08e0c71d","44f9cdc2-f4bf-466e-87d5-fb765ad4864a","074f248d-8d73-4c8f-a97e-d8e82c5be5fc","buy_buttons","d505cdfe-d5cf-4aff-8e9e-abca6dae66eb","98db29ee-a7dc-429e-8129-bf71131627da","149aabfb-9fd8-4472-a633-6032dbe01ed0","collapsible_tab_eWGzcG","collapsible_tab_wNCAKj","collapsible_tab_QGKJBE","collapsible_tab_WiqM8k","description"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"enable_sticky_info":true,"display_variant_image_first":false,"disable_prepend":false,"hide_variants":false,"variant_image_filtering":"none","image_zoom":"none","thumbnails_ratio":"square","arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":false,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","video_player":"play_btn","enable_video_looping":false,"autoplay_videos_pause_btn":false,"video_sound_btn":false,"video_timeline":false,"play_btn_color_scheme":"accent-1","sound_btn_color_scheme":"inverse","timeline_color":"accent-1","